  "ingredients": [
    "1 (8 pound) fully cooked bone-in ham",
    "0.5 cup brown sugar",
    "1 (6 ounce) can apple juice",
    "0.5 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 cup milk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1S_9pCog3pBhTrG2qnV6guJYMg8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233614-baked-ham-with-sweet-gravy-ddmfs-step1-12567-3f50e25961044b16b98642e049714704.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233614/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place ham, cut-side down, into a large roasting pan. Press brown sugar evenly onto ham. Pour apple juice into the pan. Cover the pan with a lid or aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_q1Vhm8yYhEAZL4gxbW0Z_0I-n4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233614-baked-ham-with-sweet-gravy-ddmfs-step2-12726-c057b2f301db4c58be1f5756cbdd24ac.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233614/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until ham is heated through, about 1 hour 20 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read 145 degrees F (62 degrees C). Let ham rest for 10 minutes before transferring to a serving plate. Pour remaining pan juices into a saucepan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SzLrGh5OmRZBMIcZrfw-va3o-fQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233614-baked-ham-with-sweet-gravy-ddmfs-step4-12724-11ae8a06e53b47beb474726a94142bff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233614/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour and milk in a jar with a lid; shake until mixture is blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/c3lRfiignADtFLxCXpqCLnwUE1E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233614-baked-ham-with-sweet-gravy-ddmfs-step6-12733-41d48decea554566923c1c4349da6eed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233614/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring pan juices to a boil. Slowly whisk flour mixture into the saucepan and cook until gravy is thick, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/U5k6a1l3b4HzKDRTlwcQNsp_AmA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233614-baked-ham-with-sweet-gravy-ddmfs-step7-12737-baa824f706894294a4240ff24730634d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233614/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
